<section class="section faq" id="support">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2>Answers before checkout</h2>
    <p>Clear answers on delivery, returns, payments, and sizing - everything you need to know before checkout.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <div class="faq-list" data-faq>
      <details open><summary>When does free UK delivery apply?</summary><p>Orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery. Below that, standard UK delivery is a flat £4.99 - always shown in your cart before you pay, with no surprises at checkout.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long will my order take to arrive?</summary><p>Most UK orders arrive within about 8-21 days from when you place your order - this covers preparing and dispatching your order, then delivery, and the estimate for each item is shown on its product page. International delivery takes longer and varies by destination. As soon as your order is dispatched we email you a tracking link so you can follow it to your door.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is your returns and refund policy?</summary><p>You have 14 days from delivery to change your mind and return an item (return postage is covered by you). If anything arrives faulty, damaged, or incorrect within 30 days of delivery, we’ll put it right with a full refund or free replacement - including delivery. Please <a href="#support" data-contact-open>contact us</a> first and we’ll guide you through it. Full details are in our <a href="/policies/refund-policy">returns &amp; refunds policy</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I order the wrong size or item?</summary><p>No problem - message us and we’ll help you find the right size or product, or arrange an exchange or return. For harnesses, collars, and clothing, check the size guide on the product page before ordering to get the best fit first time.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you deliver outside the UK?</summary><p>Yes. We ship across the EU (£14.99) and to many other countries (£23.99), with the exact rate shown at checkout. Orders delivered outside the UK may be subject to local import duties or taxes set by the destination country - these aren’t included in our prices.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What payment methods can I use, and is checkout secure?</summary><p>Checkout is fully secure and handled by Shopify. You can pay with major credit and debit cards, plus Apple Pay and Google Pay. We never see or store your card details.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I buy without creating an account?</summary><p>Yes. You can check out as a guest and complete your order without creating a store account.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Are discounts and offers applied automatically?</summary><p>Yes - free delivery over £50 and any active offers are applied for you automatically at checkout, so there are no codes to hunt for.</p></details>
    </div>
    <aside class="support-card" aria-label="Support prompt">
      <span>Need help choosing?</span>
      <strong>Tell us your pet, routine, and problem to solve.</strong>
      <p>We can point you toward cleaning, walking, feeding, or daily-care products before you buy.</p>
      <button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-contact-open aria-haspopup="dialog">Ask support</button>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // Single-open accordion: opening one entry closes the others, so the FAQ
  // never grows past one expanded row and stays compact. `toggle` doesn't
  // bubble, so we listen in the capture phase on the container.
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-faq]');
    if (!root) return;
    root.addEventListener('toggle', function (e) {
      var t = e.target;
      if (t.tagName === 'DETAILS' && t.open) {
        root.querySelectorAll('details[open]').forEach(function (d) { if (d !== t) d.open = false; });
      }
    }, true);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "FAQ accordion", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ accordion" }] }
{% endschema %}
